```{=html}
<div class="pub">
  <% for (const item of items) { %>
    <div class="pub-item">
      <h4><%= item.title %></h4>
      <p class="pub-authors"><%= item.authors %></p>
      <div class="pub-meta">
        <span class="pub-meta-journal"><%= item.journal %></span>
        <span class="pub-meta-date"><%= item.date %></span>
      </div>
      <div class="pub-links">
        <a href=<%- item.doi %> class="pub-link link-btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DOI</a>
        <a href=<%- item.pdf %> class="pub-link link-btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PDF</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  <% } %>
</div>
```
